# Dependency credits

`src/PS5LM.Companion.App/About/ThirdPartyDependencies.cs` is what the About page lists: name, package ids, licence, and project URL. It covers packages referenced by `src/**/*.csproj` and `Directory.Build.props`. Test-only packages stay off the list.

When a NuGet package is added, removed, renamed, or its version changes:

- Update the entry in `ThirdPartyDependencies` when the package is part of the shipped app.
- Re-check the licence expression on nuget.org for that version. A licence can change between versions.
- Re-check the project or repository URL.
- Keep the README "Dependencies" section on the same set.
